i-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.70<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170912013154&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Reward_Box_e4ab1a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a reward box.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Present\">Present</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Present%20%28Postman%29\">Present (Postman)</a> and Present (Explosive).<br/>\nThese are the possible things that the Reward Box can transform into:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>4 - 16 <a href=\"#/wiki/Chameleon%20Rune\">Chameleon Runes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\">Time Ring</a></li></ul>\n<p>And possibly more.\n</p><p>The Reward Box is given by NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Casper\">Casper</a> after you successfully finish the <a href=\"#/quest/last-creep-standing\">Last Creep Standing</a>.\n</p><p><small><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Reward Box/Statistics </i> </span></small>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div 